    's1_body'  => 'Opes Health Systems Sarl operates as a <strong>health data intermediary and interoperability platform</strong>. We do not provide clinical advice or act as a healthcare provider. We facilitate the secure, consent-governed exchange of patient health records between registered healthcare facilities and patients.',

    's2_title' => '2. Legal Basis for Processing',
