    's10_title' => '10. Children and Minors',
    's10_intro' => 'OpesCare may process health records for minors (persons under 18 years of age in the Republic of Cameroon). The following safeguards apply:',
    's10_items' => [
        'Consent for the registration and health data processing of a minor must be provided by a parent or lawfully appointed guardian.',
